Objective
- Project waits on the human for Stage-4 signoff on issue #10 (HLD-0001/0002 + DD-0001..0005). On signoff, close out the baseline and execute Stage 5: tasks #15→#24 in dependency order (one per DD, test/doc pairs), then review #25, docs #26, Stage-8 #9.
Requirements
- Every message the system produces carries 3 bits for the human: (1) there is a problem, (2) what it is (file/line/rule id + offending content), (3) what the human can do next. Standard is normative at docs/HLD-0001.md §9.3.
- Commit style <type>: <summary> (REQ-0001); push-to-main allowed for this project (user directed 2026-11-07). Agents may inform but never sign off gates.
- No invented CLI surface in message examples — verified commands: dod index / check [--fix] / trace [--require REQ-xxxx] [--json] / explain / report / init.
